    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Part.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part</code></a> from the given method name part, the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> the part originates from and the\nstart parameter index.",
      "translation": "根据给定的方法名部分、该部分所属的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> 以及起始参数索引，创建一个新的 <a href=\"Part.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part</code></a>。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the <a href=\"../../../core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a> referenced should be matched ignoring case.",
      "translation": "返回是否应该忽略大小写来匹配引用的<a href=\"../../../core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns how many method parameters are bound by this part.",
      "translation": "返回此部分绑定的方法参数数量。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
