    {
      "source": "A single part of a method name that has to be transformed into a query part. The actual transformation is defined by\na <a href=\"Part.Type.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type</code></a> that is determined from inspecting the given part. The query part can then be looked up via\n<a href=\"#getProperty()\"><code>getProperty()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "方法名中需要转换为查询部分的一个单独部分。实际的转换由 `<a href=\"Part.Type.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type</code></a>` 定义，该类型是通过检查给定部分确定的。随后，可以通过 `<a href=\"#getProperty()\"><code>getProperty()</code></a>` 查找查询部分。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The various types of ignore case that are supported.",
      "translation": "支持的多种忽略大小写类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The type of method name part.",
      "translation": "方法名部分的类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
